# Mustache Placeholder Reference

All `.mustache` template files use these variables:

| Placeholder        | Description         | Example             |
|--------------------|--------------------|---------------------|
| `theme_name`       | Theme name         | Marvellous Starter  |
| `slug`            | Directory slug      | marvellous-starter  |
| `author`          | Author name         | Ashley Shaw         |
| `author_uri`      | Author site         | https://example.com |
| `description`     | Theme description   | A modern block theme|
| `version`         | Theme version       | 1.0.0               |
| `license`         | License             | GPL-3.0-or-later    |
| `license_url`     | License URL         | ...                 |
| `theme_namespace` | PHP namespace       | Marvellous_Starter  |
| `textdomain`      | I18n textdomain     | marvellous-starter